# Global git excludes (XDG path; git reads this with no core.excludesFile set).
#
# Applies to EVERY repo on this machine, so keep it to machine/OS noise that no
# project should ever track. Project-specific rules belong in that project's
# .gitignore; dotfiles-repo rules belong in ~/.gitignore.

# Claude Code per-project local settings — machine-local, never shared
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# macOS Finder metadata. Written into any directory Finder or a file dialog
# touches, so it turns up in checkouts without anyone opening Finder directly.
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Thumbnail and directory metadata from other platforms, for repos shared with
# Windows/Linux collaborators
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Editor swap/undo files
*.swp
*.swo
.~lock.*#
